source ArtifactComics
name Artifact Comics

villain Anomalos
name Anomalos
from ArtifactComics
challenge Counting on Countermeasures
At the start of the villain turn, if The Chronoplast is not a target, either add a token to The Anomaly or play the top card of the villain deck.

villain Blockbuster
name Blockbuster
from ArtifactComics

villain Hexterminator
name Hexterminator
from ArtifactComics

villain LouGarou
name Lou Garou
from ArtifactComics
challenge Bayou Brew Grew Lou
Lou Garou's max HP for this game is 150.

villain Tombstone
name Tombstone
from ArtifactComics
challenge Shoot 'N' Plunder
Whenever a villain target enters play after setup, activate its "start of turn" effect. Whenever a card is moved from under Tombstone to a non-villain deck, Tombstone regains 2 HP.

variant Tombstone1883
name Tombstone 1883
from ArtifactComics
base Tombstone
challenge Rattle 'Em, Boys!
Whenever a villain target is destroyed, either the hero with the highest HP destroys one of their ongoing or equipment cards, or Tombstone deals that hero (H) minus 2 projectile damage.

villain HighRoller
name High Roller
from ArtifactComics
challenge Mammon's House Rules
At the start of each hero turn, each player with more than 4 cards in their hand discards 1 card, then each player with more than 3 non-character cards in play destroys 1 of their non-character cards.

villain Gozu
name Gozu
from ArtifactComics
challenge Year of the Boar
At the start of the villain turn, each villain target regains 3 HP.

villain Gutterback
name Gutterback
from ArtifactComics
challenge A Bowling League of Their Own
At the start of the game, search the villain deck for both copies of Gutterball. Remove one from the game, and put the other into play. Gutterball is always indestructible. At the start of the villain turn, if Gutterball has 0 or fewer HP, restore it to 10 HP, then Gutterback flips. Otherwise, discard the top 3 cards of each non-villain deck.

villain Jormungandr
name Jormungandr
from ArtifactComics
challenge Catastrophic Colossus
Set Jormungandr's HP to 200. * on villain exoskeleton cards = (H) times 5 instead.

villain Khazanax
name Khazanax
from ArtifactComics
challenge Unyielding Army
The first time each turn a non-character villain target is destroyed, flip it face-down. At the start of the villain turn, flip each face-down villain card face up, treating it as if it were just put into play.

villain MissCalculate
name Miss Calculate
from ArtifactComics
challenge Calculated Risks
Miss Calculate's max HP for this game is 1.

villain SubjectX
name Subject-X
from ArtifactComics
challenge Method Madness
When there are 8 or more tokens on Subject-X, the heroes lose the game!

